      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's better to be safe but i'm really trying to avoid a doctor visit if i can. honestly i've heard from a few friends that it's totally fine as long as u take it at a different time of day, like in the morning and the pill at night. does it actually matter when i take them? if i space them out a lot can i just go ahead and try it without the hassle of an appointment?",
